.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH alias 1  "alias " 
.SH NAME
alias \- Manage the `fg` shell alias (install|uninstall|show)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBalias\fR [\fB\-\-shell\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIACTION\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the `fg` shell alias (install|uninstall|show)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-shell\fR \fI<SHELL>\fR
Shell to manage (bash, zsh or fish; default: $SHELL or bash)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIACTION\fR>
install, uninstall or show
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg alias install
  fg alias show
